# Tes endpoint manual — buka file ini di VS Code (ekstensi "REST Client")
# lalu klik "Send Request" di atas tiap blok. Backend harus sudah jalan.
# Variabel: ubah @base bila backend tidak di localhost:3001.

@base = http://localhost:3001

### 1. Cek server
GET {{base}}/api/health

### 2. Daftar laporan (halaman 1, 10 per halaman)
GET {{base}}/api/reports?page=1&limit=10

### 3. Cari + filter + urutan lama dulu
GET {{base}}/api/reports?q=jalan&status=pending&order=asc&limit=5

### 4. Buat laporan (status selalu pending dari server)
POST {{base}}/api/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Jalan berlubang di Jl. Merdeka",
  "deskripsi": "Lubang besar di tengah jalan, bahaya untuk motor"
}

### 5. Detail satu laporan (ganti 1 dengan id yang ada)
GET {{base}}/api/reports/1

### 6. Riwayat status satu laporan
GET {{base}}/api/reports/1/history

### 7. Setujui laporan (ganti id)
PATCH {{base}}/api/reports/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "approved"
}

### 8. Tolak laporan (ganti id)
PATCH {{base}}/api/reports/2/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "rejected"
}

### 9. Bulk approve 3 laporan sekaligus (hanya yang pending yang berubah)
PATCH {{base}}/api/reports/bulk-status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ids": [1, 2, 3],
  "status": "approved"
}

### 10. Ubah isi laporan pending (ganti id)
PATCH {{base}}/api/reports/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Jalan berlubang (revisi)",
  "deskripsi": "Lubang makin melebar setelah hujan"
}

### 11. Hapus laporan pending (ganti id)
DELETE {{base}}/api/reports/1

### 12. Coba status tak valid (harusnya 400)
PATCH {{base}}/api/reports/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "pending"
}

### 13. Unduh Excel (.xlsx) sesuai filter — respons berupa file, bukan JSON
GET {{base}}/api/reports/export.xlsx?status=pending&order=asc
Accept: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet
